      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        82.86609649658203,
        403.08349609375,
        527.397216796875,
        417.5265197753906
      ],
      "text": "worsening of radiological changes since baseline. An isolated positive smear or culture without",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
