        70.86609649658203,
        538.8914184570312,
        527.5442504882812,
        553.3344116210938
      ],
      "text": "If treatment was modified or extended for participants allocated to either strategy, those people may",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.997099876403809,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
