      ],
      "text": "still have been on treatment at the final follow-up visit 76 weeks after randomization. In this situation,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.995549201965332,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        565.2913818359375,
        527.4124145507812,
        579.734375
      ],
      "text": "for the primary efficacy outcome classification, the end of treatment outcome was defined at this",
